algos_full_analysis.sh: Run this to have the whole analysis be re-run in the background. Results will be outputted in the experiment output folder.

params: These are generated by the algos_full_analysis.sh script for STRUCTURE to work properly. 

seed.txt: This is produced by STRUCTURE for reproducibility. They are the seeds for randomization at each run.

summary_input.sh: Run this to get a summary of the input data